<p>You harness the chaos created by high insanity.</p><p>Each time you trigger an insanity chaotic effect with a power higher than <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">28, 19, 15, 12, 10</acronym> or lower than <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-28, -19, -15, -12, -10</acronym> you gain a chaos orb for 10 turns (this effect can only happen once per turn).</p><p>Each orb increases your damage by 3% and can stack up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6.</acronym></p>